    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90451.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 46,
    "turn_text": "There is this emoluments clause in the Constitution that was designed to prevent presidents from doing just this thing. You've introduced a bill to try and strengthen enforcement of that.",
