      },
      {
        "text": "Legislative action is an appropriate mechanism for improving constitutional enforcement.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience recognizes the emoluments clause as relevant and significant.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
