        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "It is possible to stop gifts from foreign leaders from occurring or require them to be returned.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Senate lawmakers appear to be in denial regarding serious ethical violations by President Trump.",
