    "turn_text": "You represent Silicon Valley, or part of Silicon Valley, and you say, well, I don't think they were intentionally cooperating with the Russians and the nefarious way they were trying to maximize their profit. I accept that, but they also weren't very forthcoming in their interactions with Congress.",
