    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90451.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 74,
    "turn_text": "Right. I think they, you know, it's embarrassing. And they probably, you know, feel some sense of shame that their platforms were used to, you know, weaponize the foreign adversary's effort to undermine our democracy. But what I have told them is it is better to just completely be forthcoming now than to have just a drip, drip, drip of information coming out about",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_06",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
