        "text": "It is embarrassing that their platforms were used by a foreign adversary to undermine democracy.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has advised them to be fully transparent now rather than gradually releasing information.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "They likely feel some sense of shame regarding the misuse of their platforms.",
        "confidence": 0.92
